              "text": "<strong>模块概述</strong>"
            }
          },
          {
            "template_id": "paragraph_medium",
            "content": {
              "text": "获取能源和包容性能源服务是社会进步、经济增长和发展的基本驱动力，<br>同时与人权密切相关。 <br /><br />尽管如此，全球仍有6.66亿人无法获得能源。 在许多地方，即使有能源，它可能也不会被公平分配，个人可能负担不起，服务可能间歇性、不良安装或不安全。 向可持续能源的转变为纠正全球能源获取不平衡提供了一个机会。 [needs translation] <br /><br />In this module, we shine a light on energy access and inclusive energy services, recognizing them as essential to achieve fundamental<strong> human rights</strong> and <strong>essential drivers of social progress and economic growth.</strong> <br />We explore how expanding energy access can transform lives, improving <strong> health outcomes,</strong> enhancing <strong>educational opportunities, </strong>advancing<strong> gender equality, and </strong>reducing<strong> poverty.<br /><br /></strong>We discuss global and specific challenges in addressing energy access gaps and describe <strong>innovative solutions for increasing energy access</strong> and<strong> ensuring that no one is left behind</strong>.<br /><br />"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
